        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMWLdMUmToo6uwx8Vzcljz4PgCd\"><em><strong>The diagrams below give information about the manufacture of frozen fish pies.</strong> <strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task&nbsp; 1 - Manufacture of frozen fish pies</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh sản xuất b&aacute;nh c&aacute; đ&ocirc;ng lạnh</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất b&aacute;nh c&aacute; đ&ocirc;ng lạnh - b&aacute;nh ăn liền.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WC1CdzFMdosCLcxEsW2l4ctEgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>to&agrave;n bộ quy tr&igrave;nh bao gồm nhiều bước<em> (multiple interconnected stages)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2VPdMAvPoFqkkxqptzlZnh8gMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>bắt đầu từ việc chuẩn bị nguy&ecirc;n liệu th&ocirc;<em> (preparation of raw ingredients)</em> v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c khi cấp đ&ocirc;ng, lưu trữ v&agrave; ph&acirc;n phối sản phẩm cuối c&ugrave;ng<em> (freezing, storage, and final distribution of the finished product).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c bước chuẩn bị nguy&ecirc;n liệu</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Khoai t&acirc;y&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">được vận chuyển</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">delivered</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">),&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">l&agrave;m sạch</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">cleaned</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">),&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">gọt vỏ</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">peeled</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">) v&agrave;&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">cắt l&aacute;t</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">sliced</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Sau đ&oacute;, khoai t&acirc;y&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">được luộc</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">boiled</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">),&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">l&agrave;m lạnh</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">chilled</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">) v&agrave;&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">lưu trữ</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">stored</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">) cho đến khi cần.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">C&aacute; hồi tươi&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">được vận chuyển</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">transported</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">) v&agrave; phải được chế biến trong v&ograve;ng 12 giờ.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">C&aacute; hồi&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">được hấp</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">cooked in a steam oven</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">),&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">loại bỏ da v&agrave; xương</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">skin and bones are removed</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">), v&agrave;&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">kiểm tra</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">inspected</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: C&aacute;c bước lắp r&aacute;p, đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;i v&agrave; ph&acirc;n phối</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">C&aacute; hồi đ&atilde; chế biến&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">được trộn với đậu, nước sốt v&agrave; khoai t&acirc;y</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">mixed with peas, sauce, and potatoes</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">) trong hộp đựng d&ugrave;ng được trong l&ograve; vi s&oacute;ng.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">C&aacute;c hộp b&aacute;nh&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">được ni&ecirc;m phong</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">sealed</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">),&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">bọc</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">wrapped</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">),&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">d&aacute;n nh&atilde;n</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">labeled</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">) v&agrave;&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">cấp đ&ocirc;ng</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">frozen</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Cuối c&ugrave;ng, sản phẩm&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">được chuyển đến kho lạnh</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">transferred to cold storage units</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">) v&agrave;&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">ph&acirc;n phối</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;(</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">delivered</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">) đến c&aacute;c nh&agrave; b&aacute;n lẻ.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2447,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AfYJdhH6ioTgCpx73XDlQLCVglf\">The diagrams illustrate the process of manufacturing frozen fish pies.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 20380,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2448,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the production consists of multiple interconnected stages, beginning with the preparation of raw ingredients and ending with the freezing, storage, and final distribution of the finished product. Both potatoes and salmon are prepared separately in distinct processing lines before their ingredients are ultimately combined to create ready-to-eat pies for retail sale.</p>",
            "question_id": 20380,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2449,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>At the initial stage, potatoes are delivered to the factory, where they are thoroughly cleaned, peeled, and sliced into smaller pieces suitable for cooking. These slices are then boiled, chilled, and carefully stored until required for later use. Meanwhile, fresh salmon is transported to the facility and must be processed within 12 hours of delivery to preserve its freshness. It is then cooked in a steam oven, after which the skin and bones are removed and discarded. In the next step, the remaining flesh is meticulously inspected to ensure that only high-quality portions are selected for the following phase.</p>",
            "question_id": 20380,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2450,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Following those preparatory stages, the prepared salmon will be mixed with peas, sauce, and the previously stored potatoes in microwaveable containers, which are sealed to create individual portions. After assembly, each pie is wrapped, labeled, and frozen at controlled temperatures to maintain its flavor and texture. Finally, the finished products are transferred to cold storage units, kept there until dispatch, and then delivered to retailers for public sale.</p>",
            "question_id": 20380,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
        "writing_graph_image": "71769073-fd1a-414e-934f-a26b69a70ffe",
